+## Anki Offline Sync API
+
+The settings page uses these endpoints to configure the Mac connection without
+typing a long token with the device buttons.
+
+### `GET /api/anki`
+
+Returns the saved server URL and whether a token is present. The API token is
+write-only and is never returned.
+
+```json
+{
+  "serverUrl": "http://192.168.1.23:5050",
+  "hasApiToken": true,
+  "configured": true
+}
+```
+
+### `POST /api/anki`
+
+Updates the persistent Anki connection settings. Omit `apiToken` to preserve
+the existing token.
+
+```bash
+curl -X POST \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{"serverUrl":"http://192.168.1.23:5050","apiToken":"paste-token-here"}' \
+  http://crosspoint.local/api/anki
+```
+
